# QGroundControl Build Configuration

## Custom Module Structure
- Place custom modules in `src/Custom/` directory
- Create separate CMakeLists.txt for each module
- Include all source files in `target_sources()`
- Add include directories with `target_include_directories()`

## Qt Module Linking
```cmake
# Link required Qt modules
target_link_libraries(${CMAKE_PROJECT_NAME} PRIVATE
    Qt6::Positioning
    Qt6::Core
    Qt6::Qml
)
```

## Include Directory Patterns
```cmake
target_include_directories(${CMAKE_PROJECT_NAME} PRIVATE 
    ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}
    ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/..  # Add src directory to include path
)
```

## Source File Organization
```cmake
target_sources(${CMAKE_PROJECT_NAME}
    PRIVATE
        MissionGenerator/MissionService.cc
        MissionGenerator/MissionService.h
        MissionGenerator/PtahMissionGenerator.cc
        MissionGenerator/PtahMissionGenerator.h
        MissionGenerator/MissionUploadService.cc
        MissionGenerator/MissionUploadService.h
)
```

## Common Build Issues
- **Algorithm Header**: Avoid `<algorithm>` includes, use Qt alternatives
- **Qt Positioning**: Always link `Qt6::Positioning` for coordinate operations
- **QML Types**: Ensure QML_ELEMENT is used for QML type registration
- **Dependencies**: Check that all required Qt modules are linked

## Build Commands
- **Debug Build**: `cmake --build build/qt6-Windows --target QGroundControl --config Debug`
- **Release Build**: `cmake --build build/qt6-Windows --target QGroundControl --config Release`
- **Clean Build**: Delete build directory and reconfigure